title: Choosing Our Enemies
new-page: true
view-if: year <= 1930 and enemies_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; enemies_timer = 18
max-visits: 3
is-card: true
card-image: img/ddp_poster_4.jpeg
tags: party_affairs

= Choosing our enemies

In our media and campaign materials, who should we consider as our main opponents?

[? if enemies != 0 : Previously, we had considered the [+ enemies +] as our prior enemies. Is a change of direction necessary? ?]


- @anti_dem:The Undemocratic Parties off the <span style="color: var(--kpd-colour);">Left</span> and the [? if nsdap_formed = 0: <span style="color: var(--dap-colour);">far</span>?][? if nsdap_formed = 1: <span style="color: var(--nsdap-colour);">far</span>?]-<span style="color: var(--dnvp-colour);">right</span> - The KPD, DNVP and  [? if dap_formed: <span style="color: var(--dap-colour);">Volkisch movement</span>?][? if nsdap_formed: <span style="color: var(--nsdap-colour);">Volkisch movement</span>?]!
- @far_right: The [? if dap_formed: <span style="color: var(--dap-colour);">far</span>?][? if nsdap_formed: <span style="color: var(--nsdap-colour);">far</span>?]-<span style="color: var(--dnvp-colour);">right</span>, the DNVP, and [? if dap_formed: DAP ?][? if nsdap_formed: NSDAP ?].
- @far_left: The <span style="color: var(--kpd-colour);">Far</span>-<span style="color: var(--uspd-colour);">Left</span> parties of the USPD and KPD.
- @socialist: The <span style="color: var(--spd-colour);">Left</span><span style="color: var(--uspd-colour);">-t</span><span style="color: var(--kpd-colour);">Wing</span> parties of the SPD, USPD and the KPD.
- @easy_discard

@anti_dem
on-arrival: enemies = "Anti-Democratic parties"; sammlung_strength += 5; linksliberale_strength += 5; new_middle_dnvp -= 7; workers_kpd -= 5; new_middle_dap -= 7 if nsdap_formed == 0; new_middle_nsdap -= 7 if nsdap_formed == 1; ddp_new_middle += 6; kpd_relation -= 8; dnvp_relation -= 8 sammlung_dissent -= 5; linksliberale_dissent -= 5; pazifisten_dissent -= 5; nationalliberale_dissent -= 4

Attacking the [? if dap_formed: <span style="color: var(--dap-colour);">far</span>?][? if nsdap_formed: <span style="color: var(--nsdap-colour);">far</span>?]-<span style="color: var(--dnvp-colour);">right</span> and <span style="color: var(--kpd-colour);">left</span> is popular among all of our party except some members of the Nationalliberale, who would prefer we keep our options open with the DNVP.

@far_right
unavailable-subtitle: The Nationalliberale wing pressures us to pursue a more anti-<span style="color: var(--kpd-colour);">extre</span>[? if dap_formed:<span style="color: var(--dap-colour);">mist</span>?][? if nsdap_formed:<span style="color: var(--nsdap-colour);">mist</span>?] attitude, avoiding the issue of the DNVP.
choose-if: linksliberale_strength + pazifisten_strength < nationalliberale_strength
on-arrival: enemies = "far-right"; linksliberale_strength += 5; linksliberale_dissent -= 5; sammlung_dissent -= 4; pazifisten_dissent -= 5; nationaliberale_dissent += 5; new_middle_dap -= 7 if nsdap_formed == 0; new_middle_nsdap -= 7 if nsdap_formed == 1; new_middle_dnvp -= 7; ddp_new_middle += 7

Attacking the [? if dap_formed: <span style="color: var(--dap-colour);">far</span>?][? if nsdap_formed: <span style="color: var(--nsdap-colour);">far</span>?]-<span style="color: var(--dnvp-colour);">right</span> is popular among all the party, except the nationaliberale, who prefer we focus on the communists instead. Tensions with the DNVP have increased due to this.

@far_left
on-arrival: enemies = "Far-Left"; nationalliberale_strength += 5; kpd_relation -= 8; uspd_relations -= 8; dvp_relation += 5; dnvp_relations +=5; z_relation += 5; new_middle_kpd -= 5; new_middle_uspd -= 5

Attacking the KPD and USPD is popular amongst the Nationalliberale, the Linksliberale and Pazifisten, however, would rather atack the far-right instead. This is, however, popular amongst our middle class base.

@socialist
on-arrival: enemies = "Socialists"; nationalliberale_strength += 5; linksliberale_strength -= 5; spd_relations -= 5; dnvp_relations += 5; uspd_relations -= 5; kpd_relations -= 5; new_middle_spd -= 4; new_middle_kpd -= 4; new_middle_uspd -= 4; dnvp_relations += 5; dvp_relations += 8
choose-if: linksliberale_strength + pazifisten_strength > nationalliberale_strength
unavailable-subtitle: The left-wing elements of our party will never allow this.

Attacking the KPD, USPD and SPD is unpopular amongst everyone except the National-Liberals. Our support amongst the middle class has increased. Tensions with the left has increased.
